{
 "title": "About PlugMan Plugin",
 "story": [
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "711902a2c7ee43eb",
   "text": "PlugMan is a plugin manager for Federated Wiki. It began life as an explicit clone of Ward Cunningham's [[Plugmatic]] plugin (v1.5.1) and keeps its markup and routes while growing new administration features."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "2f538303a2750c3b",
   "text": "This plugin queries the origin server for information about installed plugins. Server administrators can install new or updated existing plugins from included inventories."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "725d380d0f4119c6",
   "text": "See [[PlugMan Browse]] also in the hamburger (\u2630) menu."
  },
  {
   "type": "plugman",
   "id": "aa516c1dac55e70b",
   "text": "NAME\nPAGES\nBUNDLED\nINSTALLED\nSERVICE"
  },
  {
   "type": "markdown",
   "id": "2d06e967877db124",
   "text": "# Markup"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "b6188808197e3b69",
   "text": "Markup lines may include a full plugin name or a keyword. Keywords select columns and column order for reporting properties of each plugin."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "48788863a76362b3",
   "text": "Say STATUS for a traffic light indicating install options."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "405b19fdcca54bb4",
   "text": "Say NAME for the plugin name, sans wiki-plugin- prefix."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "826eb0f7d761ce48",
   "text": "Say MENU for Factory menu category, blank if unlisted."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "565ef5763ec2cd95",
   "text": "Say PAGES for count of about pages, blank if none."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "0887156a2681e9ae",
   "text": "Say SERVICE for months installed, blank if absent or core."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "5065dfdf958ce3d9",
   "text": "Say BUNDLED for version in wiki, blank if not bundled."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "1033c6eede13b0f9",
   "text": "Say INSTALLED for version now installed, blank if absent."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "856d733cdab8fd8e",
   "text": "Say PUBLISHED for version posted to npm, blank if none."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "698979e7fd5fce6e",
   "text": "If no columns are requested a default list will be provided. Both STATUS and PUBLISHED require slow queries of npm so these are avoided except when specific plugins are inventoried."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "id": "332c5da9a77f5fb4",
   "text": "Say BROWSE to show the about page browsing menu."
  },
  {
   "type": "markdown",
   "id": "69d2b6f107f29fe6",
   "text": "## Repositories\n\n[https://github.com/Hitchhikers-Guide-to-the-Galaxy/wiki-plugin-plugman GitHub: wiki-plugin-plugman]\n\n[https://www.npmjs.com/package/wiki-plugin-plugman npm: wiki-plugin-plugman]"
  }
 ],
